+	# LDFA: termux-tools' configure.ac fills the @TERMUX_PREFIX@/@TERMUX_APP_PACKAGE@
+	# placeholders (used in bin/pkg etc.) from these EXACT env var names, via a
+	# `${TERMUX_PREFIX+set}` test — but the framework only exported lowercase
